+# V31 scope, assumptions and closure
+
+No new physical parameter, device, capacity, load class, service threshold or failure standard was introduced. The new operating rule uses the original three equal boiler ratings and currently observable availability fractions. Availability is not completed startup/readiness. The actual ready state, gas/steam/electric balances, common station power, ordinary command queue and all execution constraints remain in the C02 model.
+
+M already had shared minimum boiler/cooling preparation; steam adds rated conditional permission beyond that minimum. The new controller never reads scenario names, the fixed60min event, the GT3 target, future demands, true repair or stop times. The scenario registry holds fixed exogenous scripts only to drive the simulator. The mailbox contains only existing M23 observable features and their available/valid clocks, current decision time and original public rating. Actual command arrivals are reviewed offline.
+
+These are observed V30 mechanism-development backgrounds, not new blind samples or annual reliability data. Both new methods have separate names and fixed context-specific scope. M to new is the added-rule contrast; new to full C still includes several mechanisms and cannot be decomposed into percentages adding to100. Raw tiny ENS stays in CSV; interruption uses unchanged V30 material criteria.
+
+All12 selected runs are H0. UPS/cold storage zero means not installed; unusedDG budget is not a maximum-autonomy result. No new endurance, clinical/OEM, humidity/cleanliness or complete hydraulic qualification was attempted. Original V30 source-load/dynamic-room and literature/R_off limitations remain inherited scope; they do not create a new feature requirement for this bounded four-run closeout.
+
+The independent12record audit, fixed-source/input check, code/interface review and targeted60tests passed. Four formal runs completed180min with no unknown tails or core/evaluation failure; no optional short trajectory, new C/M rerun, parameter search or model expansion was dispatched. The first implementation-test failure was an incomplete plant test stub, fixed by using the original real plant; no production constraint or assertion tolerance was relaxed. All original RED/failed-harness/green logs remain.
+
+Scientific producer f009bdb66d5b9d53f1ff2331f2dc58404c2d056b/source e4c740329fddcddae9e729acc24e6149d1d873e89783e0ef310e3623f604a6fa. Old858scientific files and36inputs remain byte-identical; only6scientific files were added. Later documentation-only HEADs do not relabel the old/new trajectories.
+
+Decision: 本轮模型开发可以结束。 Remaining work is the already-authorized one-package assembly and integrity/readonly replay acceptance. No additional model feature or experiment is a completion gate.
