+
+Goal: one Hirwa-equation-based REopt-family fixed-capacity offline reference, Rosales design/service/economic scope crosswalk, four reused b01 C/M records and two new180min reference records. No MPC/ML, new hardware, changes to C/M/V31 rules, parameter search, new backgrounds, paper/figures or official/author-software reproduction claims. New large data/temp only E:/hospital_ies_v32_20261027. One hospital physical worker, actual memory dispatch threshold0.85; no C large output. No push/main merge/external messages.
+
+## Design and gates
+
+- [ ] G0: preserve task, two existing freezes, review disposition, original864 source/36 input hashes and exact b01 N02/D02 four-history identity. Keep dev_grid_180/R03 historical-only, never fill b01 slots with them.
+- [ ] G1 independent input: pure raw-data/adopted-thermal/direct-aux construction; current source1160/1161/1162,12quarter-hour periods, exogenous grid60..120 only for grid branch. No C/M completed file, actual auxiliary/station loads, native partition, endogenous availability, stock/action/startup history may be read while constructing input. Separate read-isolation test, no deletion of historical data. Independently call common initialization only, without controller/episode, preserve complete t0 state/core and original H1 inventories/2400shaft budget, quantify initialization solver calls separately.
+- [ ] G2 mathematics: preserve literature balances/CHP/converters/finite fuel/storage/fees in new planner. Register strict and tiered in advance. Tiered four sequential P0,P1,P2,P3 objectives, each sum of per-carrier ENS divided by that priority/carrier's positive full-window requested energy; zero-demand terms excluded and unmet fixed0. Cost last. No huge scalar penalty, no cross-carrier ENS reporting sum. All old physical and evaluation source files unchanged.
+- [ ] G3 preregister/solve: strict normal/grid60s each, expand to300s only if no independently verified incumbent and no proof of infeasibility. Both strict verified feasible -> both strict formal; either proved infeasible -> both tiered; budget-ended unknown without incumbent -> both tiered, strict remains unknown. Incumbent may be used with actual termination/bound/gap disclosed. Tiered120s per lex layer, preserve all attempts, locks and incomplete-layer status. Reject invalid incumbent; never execute no-plan or zero-fill. No terminal-stock equality added only to the reference. Solve tiny fixtures first, then bounded hospital planning; no author numerical reproduction claim.
+- [ ] G4 mapping: one new explicit offline policy/entry, not C/M. Fixed45min planning preparation lead from15min actual queue delay +10min nominal startup +15min decision-sampling allowance=40 rounded to15min grid45. It is neither30min communication nor a readiness guarantee. Actual min-off, requested-power-dependent powered work, ramp, station electricity, transfer and protection still govern. Retain raw plan, any independently verified label canonicalization, converted requests, actual generation/arrival and execution. Identical-unit static relabeling never swaps physical state or proves dynamic equivalence; prefer common t0 identity and disclose any incompatibility. No direct storage ports or proactive cuts mapped; plan storage/unmet stay separate from actual. Common M23 minimum preparation/local real-time allocation must be disclosed; no C/M controller invocation or fallback.
+- [ ] G5 two actual runs: freeze new source/input/spec/plan/actions/selection and exact b01 cases before dispatch. Common t0 initialization,180min, H1. Normal and grid offline prefault actions may differ intentionally; no same-prefix gate for them. Failures keep prefix/unknown tail and original outputs; bounded diagnosis/retry only if necessary, no performance selection.
+- [ ] G6 independent actual audit: six records with real producer identities, native P0–P3 e/h/c requests/delivered/ENS, material interruption/recovery, gas/grid/DGshaft+Pe, initial prep once, running feeUSD2001, stores/terminal and completeness. Signed disturbed-minus-own-normal deltas; offline delta includes advance preparation difference. Match hardware/scenario/t0/physical execution/evaluation with old C/M but disclose offline information advantage. Separate plan/request/arrival/actual, power/cost components and ending stock. No online ranking, unconditional cost lower bound, clinical or annual reliability claim.
+- [ ] G7 package: all scientific reports/crosswalks/registration/independent input/provenance/plans/failed attempts/native evidence/necessary source+inputs/test/env/logs+readonly replay inside one ZIP. Lossless transport and original-byte SHA verification; aim strict100000000bytes consistent with prior preference. Fresh extracted readonly replay only, no automatic new model. Final answer states supported conclusions and stronger unverified claims, then stop.
