+Registered approximations must identify fixed GT fuel/heat slopes, any startup/auxiliary/DG rotor/queue dynamics omitted from static planning, critical-only UPS access and H1 zero cold capacity. Those remain actual original execution constraints and are measured in plan-to-actual differences; planning feasibility is not actual dynamic qualification. No finite NG budget is invented. Hirwa/Rosales original apparatus/long-horizon costs are not substituted for HospitalUSD2001/window metrics.
