+# V32 additive reference identity and limits
+
+All864 existing V31 scientific files,36 original inputs, C/M/default/V31 preparation rules and V30 evaluation remain unchanged. V32 adds independent raw input, a separate fixed-capacity mathematical planner, common-reset certificate, explicit request conversion and a named reference entry. Whole-tree SHA changes honestly; old records retain3252727 and new records will bind their true new source producer.
+
+Input grid is0,15,...180min using raw source hours1160/1161/1162 with1163as endpoint support only. Direct/auxiliary electric and adopted coil/DHW useful thermal requests follow frozen rules; fan allocation is not rescaled by added DHW. Building aux and own-plan equipment station/start consumption are separate. Pure input generation passed a copied-raw input/config read sandbox with823 read events and zero prohibited operating-result reads. Source-quality scope is metadata/evaluation only, not a demand reduction.
+
+Independent common initialization uses the original constructor/reset with no controller or episode. Both actual initial states match, GT targets[131.180288,0,0], UPS40kWh_e, cold0, DG2400kWh shaft. The empty post-reset core solver log is not proof of zero low-level initial MILP calls; total initialization solver count is null/not separately instrumented. Initial charged input and its fee are accounted once in actual evaluation, not offered as free pre-window energy.
+
+Reference permission is offline_known_window for original exogenous load/weather/grid outage; no future actual trip/start/service/stock is supplied. It is not an online/fair same-information comparison. One shared numerical reference is based primarily on Hirwa's published equations; Rosales supplies design/service/economic boundaries. No author software or officialREopt execution/numerical reproduction is claimed.
+
+Strict requires all original P0–P3 e/h/c. Pre-registered tiered adaptation is Hospital-added, lexicographic P0→P1→P2→P3 then actual-window proxy cost. Each level sums equally weighted carrier ENS divided by that level/carrier's positive full-window demand integral, excludes zero-demand terms and fixes their unmet0. Report carrier units separately. No massive penalty or changed actual material threshold. Both branches use one selected formulation per prior rule; no outcome-based swapping or tuning.
+
+The planning model retains coupled source/conversion/storage/fuel/fees, original capacities and original static coefficients. Static planning does not resolve the complete GT min-off/start/ramp/actual station/DG rotor/queue/transfer/protection trajectory. Actual engine constraints still apply and their effects are measured. Boiler variable/fixed station electricity is represented; actual startup and rotor/deadband differences are not silently zeroed in actual cost. No natural-gas budget, newPV/BESS/cold store or special terminal equality is invented. H1 UPS is critical-building-only, including its defined building auxiliary request, never arbitrary plant/station supply. DG follows the actual legacy_explicit_permission contract; the old envelope's extra conservative critical-electric cap is not a physical constraint and is not reintroduced to handicap this reference.
+
+Plan-to-request uses a fixed45min preparation lead=ceil_to15(15actual communication+10nominal GT start+15decision sampling allowance). This is not30min communication and is not a guarantee covering remaining min-off or requested-power-dependent actual powered-start work. GT and boiler targets may be requested early, converters/grid/DG use current planned requests. Ordinary queue, min-on/off, ramp and actual usefulness constraints remain. Static identical-generator relabeling preserves raw/canonical plans and audited balances/fees only, favors independently initialized online identity and does not swap physical states or prove dynamic interchangeability.
+
+Execution identity: literature_adapted_offline_onoff_preparation_plus_common_realtime_allocation. New reference controller is a bare frozen schedule reader, not a C/M policy subclass. It does not call any online optimizer or fallback controller. Common M23 minimum current critical boiler/EC preparation is a disclosed shared physical interface after the frozen controller request, not hidden C action generation. Generated, arrived and actual values can differ and are logged.
+
+full_continuous_plan_replayed=false; planned_storage_ports_executed=false; planned_unmet_directly_executed=false. The interface has no direct UPS/cold charge/discharge command. All requested active cuts remain zero; planned unmet is not treated as actual unmet. Original/canonical plan, converted requests, generated/arrived permissions, real service, fee components and ending stock must be compared separately. Lower fee with less service or lower remaining stock is not same-condition saving or a bound.
+
+Targeted actual60tests include new input/planner/controller tests plus unchanged relevant V30 public/terminal/start interfaces. They do not mean a new1363-test run. Synthetic tests, independent resets and staticMILPs are not hospital trajectories. Rejected fixture/API attempts are retained distinctly from actual failures.
